@startuml uml_sequence_history
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Patient (Marcus)" as Patient
participant "SPA Client (React/TS)" as SPA
participant "API Gateway (FastAPI)" as API
participant "Assessment Controller" as Ctrl
participant "PostgreSQL DB" as DB

Patient -> SPA: Navigates to "/history" tab
SPA -> API: GET /api/v1/assessments/history (HttpOnly JWT cookie)

API -> Ctrl: Verify session (current_user.id)
Ctrl -> DB: SELECT a.*, ir.cad_probability, ir.ascvd_10yr_risk \nFROM assessments a \nJOIN inference_results ir ON a.id = ir.assessment_id \nWHERE a.patient_id = :user_id \nORDER BY a.created_at ASC

DB -->> Ctrl: Chronological list of assessment records + inference outputs
Ctrl -> Ctrl: Compute sequential biomarker deltas between checkups\n(e.g. BP delta: 158 -> 132 = -26 mmHg)

Ctrl -->> API: Formatted time-series payload
API -->> SPA: HTTP 200 OK (Array of chronological assessment telemetry & deltas)

SPA -> SPA: Renders multi-series time-series chart (CAD Risk, Systolic BP, Cholesterol)
SPA -->> Patient: Displays visual trend trajectory, delta badges, and milestone dots

@enduml
